This package embeds data derived from files published by Chunghwa Post Co., Ltd.
(中華郵政股份有限公司), Taiwan, on its download page
https://www.post.gov.tw/post/internet/Download/all_list.jsp?ID=2201 :

  - 中英文街路名稱對照檔 (Chinese/English road name list), edition 113/01, file dated 2024-04-01
  - 村里文字巷中英對照檔 (Chinese/English village and named-lane list), edition 113/01
  - 縣市鄉鎮中英對照檔 (Chinese/English city and district list with 3-digit postal codes), edition 109/06

The vendored copies live in data/source/ (see data/source/SOURCE.md for URLs and
checksums). Chunghwa Post is the authoritative source of the English forms; this
package only reorganizes them and adds fallback rules for names that are not
listed. Translations of unlisted names are produced by this package and are
marked as such in its output.

The project donma/TaiwanAddressCityAreaRoadChineseEnglishJSON (MIT) was
consulted while designing the data layout; none of its data is included.
